   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You are working on a database that tracks inventory for a retail store chain. Whenever a new transaction is entered, you need to generate an invoice for the customer that includes their name, the date of the sale, and a list of the items bought. Create a new macro that has multiple steps and save it with a descriptive name. Then, run the macro to verify that it generates an invoice.",
